      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "# Related Post:\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1238-scrolling-in-one-category-effects-other-categories\nThis post is kinda related to it, since basically the Worlds Tab already does everything as I would expect, but for some reason the other Tabs don't.",
