  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-13T18:57:26.029Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This only applies to the Settings, Avatars and Social Tabs, for some reason the World Tab is not effected by this and works as I would expect. It just goes back to the \"starting page\" of the Tab. Also all Tabs already do this when switching between them, for example when you have your Avatar Details open in the Avatars Tab, switching between to Social and back will also close it aka bring you back to the \"starting page\". (which is what I would expect)\n# Issue:\nWhen you have details about a Person, World or Avatar open, closing your Menu and then opening that Tab again via the Quick Menu will not bring you back to the first page / \"starting page\" (not closing the details you had open). For example, when you have the Avatar Details of an Avatar open closing the Menu and then reopening the Avatars Tab via the Quick Menu will bring you back to the Avatar Details instead of closing them.\n# Suggestion:\nWhen reopening a Tab via the Quick Menu it should bring you back to the first page / close all \"Details\" you could have open. This is as I said already what the World Tab does and what the other Tabs to when switching between them. Doing this would make the UI feel way more consistent.\n# Attachments:\nHere you can see it not closing the details page: https://streamable.com/h5sfsv",
